<div><font class="grammar" color="green">phraseologicalUnit</font></div>said in reply to something that one believes will never happen<ol><li><div>c’est pas demain la veille</div></li><li><div>quand les poules auront des dents</div></li></ol></div><div><div><font class="grammar" color="green">phraseologicalUnit</font></div>expression to indicate something as being sufficient or enough<div>ça suffit</div></div><div><div><font class="grammar" color="green">interjection</font></div><ol><li><div>la bonne blague</div></li><li><div>laisse-moi rire</div></li><li><div>laissez-moi rire</div></li><li><div>mais bien sûr</div></li></ol></div><div><div><font class="grammar" color="green">phraseologicalUnit</font></div>that's a relief<div>quel soulagement</div></div><div><div><font class="grammar" color="green">phraseologicalUnit</font></div>that's all<div>c'est tout</div></div><div>/<font color="gray">ðæts ɔl foʊks</font>/, /<font color="gray">ðæts ɔːl fəʊks</font>/<br>
<div><font class="grammar" color="green">phraseologicalUnit</font></div>that is the end<div>c’est fini, les amis</div></div><div><div><font class="grammar" color="green">phraseologicalUnit</font></div>a phrase used to reply to a question whose answer the speaker doesn't want to reveal<div>ça ne regarde que moi</div></div><div><div><font class="grammar" color="green">phraseologicalUnit</font></div><ol><li>Yes!, exactly!<ol><li><div>ah oui</div></li><li><div>c'est ça</div></li><li><div>voilà</div></li></ol></li><li>There is nothing more to the issue<ol><li><div>c'est bon</div></li><li><div>c'est tout</div></li><li><div>voilà</div></li><li><div>ça y est</div></li></ol></li></ol></div><div><div><font class="grammar" color="green">phraseologicalUnit</font></div><div>première nouvelle</div></div><div><div><font class="grammar" color="green">phraseologicalUnit</font></div>there is nothing more to say or to do concerning the matter<div>un point c'est tout</div></div><div><div><font class="grammar" color="green">phraseologicalUnit</font></div>slang phrase<div>c'est ça</div></div><div><div><font class="grammar" color="green">adverb</font></div>the reason<div>c'est pourquoi</div></div><div>/<font color="gray">θæt͡ʃ</font>/<br>
